  m_text: 'Data centers are facilities that use large numbers of computers and servers
    to provide digital services.


    Using high-performance hardware can increase
    electricity consumption. If energy demand becomes too high, it may raise concerns
    among nearby communities due to higher power usage and environmental impact.


    Choosing
    <color=#FFA047><b>ARM-based</b></color> systems can help improve energy efficiency,
    as they often provide good performance while consuming less power than traditional
    alternatives.

'
